sieve-filter-v1
; Function words: the commonest words that hold a sentence together each make a set of
; their own, and every other word of the list one set, w. No function word twice in a row
; ("the the", "of of"); after an article (a, an, the) neither an article, a preposition
; nor a conjunction ("a the", "the of"); no two conjunctions in a row ("and or"). A page
; can start and stop anywhere, so any word may come first and last. Every token must still
; be a word of the list, so this implies words-v2 with the same list.
; Generated by tools/build_text_plugins.py from scowl-2020.12.07-en-60-names.txt (sha256 2b929f8e21c0ee57140482b7c4a18e23836b890ef8200ee83d21458bc8961ba4).
